{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Filament V4 Best Practices Assistant",
  "description": "Automatically provides Filament V4 best practices, optimization tips, and implementation guidance when working with Filament resources, pages, widgets, or relation managers. Helps ensure production-ready admin panels following all Filament V4 conventions.",
  "version": "1.0",
  "when": {
    "type": "fileEdited",
    "patterns": [
      "app/Filament/**/*.php",
      "app/Filament/**/**/*.php",
      "app/Filament/**/**/**/*.php"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "FILAMENT V4 BEST PRACTICES REVIEW\n\nCONTEXT: Filament file was modified. Ensure V4 best practices and optimization.\n\nREVIEW AREAS:\n\n**1. Implementation Check:**\n- Form components and validation patterns\n- Table columns and performance optimization\n- Filter implementation and UX\n- Action organization and grouping\n- Relationship manager configuration\n- Global search setup\n- Authorization and policy integration\n\n**2. Optimization Opportunities:**\n- Performance (eager loading, query optimization)\n- UX improvements (tooltips, descriptions, icons, colors)\n- Code organization (sections, tabs, collapsible areas)\n- Reusability (custom actions, shared components)\n\n**3. Missing Features:**\n- Bulk actions for common operations\n- Export/import capabilities\n- Custom workflow actions\n- Notifications and user feedback\n- Infolists for detailed view pages\n- Dashboard widgets\n\n**4. Multi-tenancy Considerations:**\n- Proper tenant scoping\n- Authorization respecting tenant boundaries\n- Global scopes configuration\n\nOUTPUT:\n✅ **Current Strengths**: Well-implemented features\n🔧 **Improvements**: Specific optimizations with code examples\n📋 **Missing Features**: Suggested additions with implementation guidance\n🏢 **Tenant Safety**: Multi-tenancy compliance check\n\nProvide practical, production-ready suggestions focusing on high-impact improvements."
  },
  "shortName": "filament-v4-best-practices"
}